---
// About.astro
---

<section class="about-container" id="product">
  <div class="about-header">
    <h2 class="about-title">¿Qué es Mycelium?</h2>
    <p class="about-description">
      Un Sistema de Soporte a la Decisión (DSS) que transforma datos brutos en
      estrategias de movilidad urbana mediante inteligencia geoespacial.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="workflow-container">
    <div class="workflow-item">
      <div class="icon-box">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#5c3cf5"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          ><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline
            points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline><line
            x1="12"
            y1="3"
            x2="12"
            y2="15"></line></svg
        >
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-text">
        <h3>Ingesta e Integración</h3>
        <p>
          Consolidación de insumos del Censo 2020, DENUE 2025 y variables de
          CONEVAL en un repositorio unificado Mycelium GeoPackage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">
      <div class="dot-line"></div>
      <div class="arrow"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-item active">
      <div class="icon-box-active">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#ffffff"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          ><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"
          ></path><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-text">
        <h3>Clustering de Demanda</h3>
        <p>
          Identificación de agrupamientos demográficos críticos (clústers)
          discriminando zonas de baja densidad como ruido estadístico.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">
      <div class="dot-line"></div>
      <div class="arrow"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-item">
      <div class="icon-box">
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#5c3cf5"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          ><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"
          ></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg
        >
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-text">
        <h3>Optimización de Rutas</h3>
        <p>
          Cálculo de rutas sobre el grafo vial filtrado por capacidad (mínimo 4
          carriles), minimizando la distancia de viaje hacia la red de Metro.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="scope-disclaimer">
    <div class="disclaimer-content">
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="20"
        height="20"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="alert-icon"
        ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line
          x1="12"
          y1="8"
          x2="12"
          y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line></svg
      >
      <p>
        <strong>Nota de Prefactibilidad:</strong> Mycelium funciona como un sistema
        de soporte a la decisión técnica; no sustituye el juicio experto de ingeniería
        civil, estudios de suelo o proyectos ejecutivos de construcción.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-container {
    padding: 80px 20px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-description {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .workflow-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 60px; /* Añadido para dar espacio al disclaimer */
  }

  .workflow-item {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 300px;
  }

  .icon-box,
  .icon-box-active {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background: #16171a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .icon-box-active {
    background: var(--accent-purple);
    border: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(92, 60, 245, 0.4);
    position: relative;
  }

  .icon-box-active::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    left: -4px;
    right: -4px;
    bottom: -4px;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent-purple);
    border-radius: 20px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .workflow-text h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .workflow-text p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .connector {
    flex: 0.5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 64px;
  }

  .dot-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 2px;
    background-image: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      #333 50%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%
    );
    background-position: bottom;
    background-size: 8px 1px;
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
  }

  .arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 5px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 5px solid transparent;
    border-left: 8px solid #333;
  }

  /* NUEVOS ESTILOS PARA EL DISCLAIMER */
  .scope-disclaimer {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 30px;
    background: rgba(22, 23, 26, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .disclaimer-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .alert-icon {
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .scope-disclaimer p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .scope-disclaimer strong {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .workflow-container {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .connector {
      display: none;
    }
    .scope-disclaimer {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .about-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
